NOT BUNDLED: FETCHED OR INSTALLED SEPARATELY
================================================================================

Stockfish                                             GPL-3.0-or-later
  Deliberately NOT vendored. Both projects invoke Stockfish as a separate
  process over the UCI protocol on stdin/stdout, at arm's length; no Stockfish
  source or binary is distributed here, and no Stockfish code is linked into
  this project. Install it yourself, see docs/07-running.md.
  https://stockfishchess.org

  Earlier revisions of this repository vendored the Stockfish 15.1 source tree
  and a Windows binary, published under this repository's root Apache-2.0
  LICENSE. That was a licence misstatement, and the Corresponding Source was
  incomplete in any case: no Makefile and no NNUE network file were ever
  committed, so the published binary could not be rebuilt from what shipped
  beside it.

  Both the binary and the 64 vendored source files have been removed from the
  working tree AND purged from git history, because deleting a file in a new
  commit does not withdraw what was already distributed. Stockfish is now
  invoked as a separate process over UCI and never redistributed here.

Dobot SDK for Linux / macOS                           Proprietary, Dobot
  libDobotDll.so / libDobotDll.dylib are NOT included. Download from
  https://download.dobot.cc/ if driving the arm on those platforms.

Dobot Magician manuals                                Proprietary, Dobot
  Not redistributed. Available from https://download.dobot.cc/

  One exception was corrected: Dobot-Communication-Protocol-V1.1.5.pdf had been
  committed in an earlier revision and was reachable from the published branch.
  It has been purged from history along with the Stockfish material above.

  The pinout diagram at hikaru-v2/hardware/dobot-peripheral-interface.png is
  retained as hardware reference for this build.

